  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the ARJC 2026 Abortion and Reproductive Justice Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trust for Indigenous Culture and Health works in East Africa for climate justice, gender justice, and holistic health and also hosts the MAMA Network, a regional movement of African activists working on self-managed abortion. This grant will support MAMA Network to host the fifth global Abortion and Reproductive Justice Conference in June 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
